女たちの狂気的な部分の描写も\nとても面白いです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休み前に読むのが丁度いいかも!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非読んでみて下さい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46DRF02JSRB1JZGAZZKVS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今私が愛用しているシャーペンたちです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか紹介したくなったので紹介しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ぺんてる」と「ZEBRA」です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも書きやすくて好きなのですが1番好きなのはピンクのぺんてるです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色も凄く可愛いし軽くて持ちやすい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上シャーペンの紹介でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《連載》ぽ ん か ん さ つ #24"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐドラマが始まりますね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も出来上がったものはまだ見ていないのでとてもドキドキワクワクしています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで撮影の休憩時間中のゆいぽんの様子を覗いてみましょう ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46FGZX44FZYX3CT3C5RSA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が携帯をいじっている中\nなにやらゆいぽんはゴミ箱の「PUSH」の文字を見ているようです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46H5970F35K1QCXGZVAEM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「PUSH!!!!!!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいぃぃぃぃいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供っぽい一面が垣間見れました( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も可愛いゆいぽんなのでした〜(今日のわんこ風)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6773":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございます！\n一つ一つの言葉がじわじわと胸にしみました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもパワーもらいました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにこの一年間、沢山のことがあったけれど、\n一分一秒も無駄な時間はなかったと思います！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一秒一秒がとても大切な時間で、\n涙が出るのは、それだけ期待もしたし、頑張ったから！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一周年記念日にお台場合衆国でライブをさせていたはだきました！\nその時に並んでくださってたのを見て！感動してしまい、ついパシャリと盗撮してしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の頃に比べ、沢山のファンのかたがいて、\n支えてくれて......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、色々なことに気づかせていただけたのも、大好きなメンバー！\nそして、スタッフ、\n何よりもファンの皆様です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテトを頬張るヤマポテトおねぇーちゃんです！もう中身が少なくなっている！わぁーおっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、\n『妹！妹！』\nっていってくるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな可愛くて、面白くて、優しいおねぇーちゃんがだいすきなんだー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹で良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっと、もう一人私を狙うおねぇちゃんがいたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投げキスとかめっちゃ飛ばしてく！\nまるでせいたんみたいだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁそれを私は華麗によけてみせるのだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヘヘッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、斜め前にはニヤニヤしながらblogコメントを読むネネコロを盗撮！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい笑顔だ！\nニヤニヤと言うより、\nもうすでに笑ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー内ではよくみる光景だッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、そっとしてあげて、メンバー誰しもがそうだから.........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても、ねねころの携帯がやけに大きく見える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃんちっちゃいからなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そう言えば昨日50?髪切ったんだー！\n写メ張りすぎて、サイズオーバーだから今回は残念っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ひめたんとミサミサとまあやでイオンのキャンペーン中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/4